OL,3,GNEWSAReform councillor suspended after
OL,4,Adrink-drive charge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Reform UK councillor has been
OL,7,Fsuspended from the party after being
OL,8,Fcharged with drink-driving.
OL,10,FPeter Reeve was elected on 7 May to
OL,11,Frepresent the Peterborough ward of
OL,12,FStanground South.
OL,14,FThe leader of the Peterborough Reform
OL,15,FUK group, Andrew O'Neil, confirmed that
OL,16,FReeve had been suspended from Reform UK
OL,17,Fby the party's general secretary, but
OL,18,Fdid not give a reason.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
