OL,3,GNEWSAReform councillor suspended after
OL,4,Adrink-drive charge
OL,5,
OL,6,FReeve appeared at Peterborough
OL,7,FMagistrates' Court on 14 August,
OL,8,Fcharged with driving a motor vehicle
OL,9,Fwhen above the legal alcohol limit, and
OL,10,Fwas granted unconditional bail.
